    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440600/extras/25e8e78c30eb81b56abd2a3537e01c5b.avif?t=1753288524\" data-has-big /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME TO THE WORLD OF FORKLIFT COMBAT!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an alternate universe, <strong>Forklift Combat</strong> reigns as the world's most popular sport. Forklifts everywhere gather to witness the ultimate showdown\u2014where only the best can earn the prestigious <strong>Forklift Certification</strong> and climb the corporate <strong>Forklift Ladder</strong> to glory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FORK UP YOUR FRIENDS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Get ready for <strong>hilarious, chaotic battles</strong> in this online and local party game for <strong>2-4 players</strong>. Whether you're duking it out from the couch or your gamer cave, one thing's for sure\u2014only the strongest (and most reckless) Forklift operators will survive!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BATTLE YOUR FRIENDS</strong> \u2013 Face off with up to 4 players in\u00a0<strong>online and local multiplayer</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440600/extras/190511c07ec064d3be3d2eaeca566452.poster.avif?t=1753288524\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440600/extras/190511c07ec064d3be3d2eaeca566452.webm?t=1753288524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440600/extras/190511c07ec064d3be3d2eaeca566452.mp4?t=1753288524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHOOSE YOUR FORKLIFT</strong> \u2013 Pick from a cast of <strong>quirky, over-the-top Forklifts</strong>, each with their own distinct style and personality. Whether you want to be an average Joe trying to get through his long work hours, or a literal raccoon- we've got you covered!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440600/extras/039905ff71e830385ba5784b3e76d78c.poster.avif?t=1753288524\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440600/extras/039905ff71e830385ba5784b3e76d78c.webm?t=1753288524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440600/extras/039905ff71e830385ba5784b3e76d78c.mp4?t=1753288524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WHAT THE FORK?!</strong> \u2013 Use <strong>wacky items</strong> and interact with chaotic <strong>environmental hazards,</strong> and <strong>crazy  maps</strong> to gain the upper hand (or just cause total mayhem). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440600/extras/611c393ede52347d1402d178f4188e86.poster.avif?t=1753288524\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440600/extras/611c393ede52347d1402d178f4188e86.webm?t=1753288524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440600/extras/611c393ede52347d1402d178f4188e86.mp4?t=1753288524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE FORKLIFTS ARE WHERE?</strong> \u2013 Battle across a variety of <strong>crazy, dynamic maps, </strong>from ancient temples to the middle of outer space\u2014each packed with unique twists, traps, and opportunities for forklift carnage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440600/extras/979eeb774f84270035a6d6aa7422d900.poster.avif?t=1753288524\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440600/extras/979eeb774f84270035a6d6aa7422d900.webm?t=1753288524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440600/extras/979eeb774f84270035a6d6aa7422d900.mp4?t=1753288524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MASTER THE ART OF THE FORK</strong> \u2013 <strong>Drift, clash, and launch your opponents</strong> with tight, fluid movement mechanics. Precision and strategy (or just dumb luck) will determine the champion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440600/extras/ec9dbe80c97eaadb99554c7a8ff6bfa4.poster.avif?t=1753288524\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440600/extras/ec9dbe80c97eaadb99554c7a8ff6bfa4.webm?t=1753288524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440600/extras/ec9dbe80c97eaadb99554c7a8ff6bfa4.mp4?t=1753288524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CLASH IT UP -\u00a0 </strong>Sparks light up when your forks collide. Use quick keys to win against clash tournaments and launch your opponent into the stratosphere! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DO YOU HAVE WHAT IT TAKES TO GET CERTIFIED?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop in, rev up, and <strong>fork 'em up!</strong> \ud83c\udfc6</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440600/extras/5650ac6ac23bbb7b1d064a378059f139.avif?t=1753288524\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
