with unique twists, traps, and opportunities for forklift carnage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440600/extras/979eeb774f84270035a6d6aa7422d900.poster.avif?t=1753288524\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440600/extras/979eeb774f84270035a6d6aa7422d900.webm?t=1753288524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440600/extras/979eeb774f84270035a6d6aa7422d900.mp4?t=1753288524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MASTER THE ART OF THE FORK</strong> \u2013 <strong>Drift, clash, and launch your opponents</strong> with tight, fluid movement mechanics. Precision and strategy (or just dumb luck) will determine the champion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440600/extras/ec9dbe80c97eaadb99554c7a8ff6bfa4.poster.avif?t=1753288524\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440600/extras/ec9dbe80c97eaadb99554c7a8ff6bfa4.webm?t=1753288524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440600/extras/ec9dbe80c97eaadb99554c7a8ff6bfa4.mp4?t=1753288524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CLASH IT UP -\u00a0 </strong>Sparks light up when your forks collide. Use quick keys to win against clash tournaments and launch your opponent into the stratosphere! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DO YOU HAVE WHAT IT TAKES TO GET CERTIFIED?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop in, rev up, and <strong>fork 'em up!</strong> \ud83c\udfc6</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=